1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
On a quiet neon bridge, two robots met.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Night after night, Nova and Orion returned to the same bridge,

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
their silent routine slowly turning into something special.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
But one stormy night, the city went dark,

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
and Nova's power slowly began to fade.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Orion shared his power, and love sparked to life.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Maybe, love isn't just human.

